t\n复用上一次运行的种子\t\n点击后，强制使用上一次生成时的种子，无论当前 seed 数值是多少\t\n复现上一次的生成结果，不用手动记录 / 输入种子\n\n\n\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [613.277587890625, 334.5083923339844], "pos": [847.14794921875, -181.40110778808594], "id": 43, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["总结：\n\n不需要固定种子，就使用Randomize Each Time（每次随机）\n\n需要固定种子（可能需要做对比），且还需要时不时更换，就使用New Fixed Random（新固定随机）\n\n\n先使用了Randomize Each Time（每次随机），随机出一个不错的种子，但是看不到种子数是多少。\n点击(Use Last Queued Seed)（使用上一次队列种子），显示之前的种子"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [503.8038330078125, 254.68380737304688], "pos": [1486.4091796875, -177.4058837890625], "id": 44, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "SEED", "links": [53, 57], "label": "SEED", "dir": 4, "type": "INT"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [153555835444136, "", "", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Seed (rgthree)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [315, 130], "pos": [1139.3309326171875, 288.0890808105469], "id": 42, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1554.8825667637154, 497.9142908506808], "scale": 0.7247295000000078}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 1, "title": "模型运行区", "bounding": [366.94866943359375, 198.39849853515625, 2770.250244140625, 721.3740234375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 2, "title": "提示词", "bounding": [-110.55772399902344, 969.0253295898438, 420, 283.6000061035156]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 3, "title": "图片上传", "bounding": [363.639892578125, 932.1390991210938, 699.2166748046875, 413.5999450683594]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 44, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 5, "